  id: silent_knock_part3_coordinates
  title: The Coordinates
  bodyText: 'The address the stranger wrote. Grid reference for what he called a
    ''pristine pre-war cache''. Could be medicine, sealed food, batteries. Could
    be exactly what it says on the paper.


    You have his word. And the memory
    of the water you gave him.'
